				[ 'question' => 'Do you cover Welton, South Cave and North Ferriby?', 'answer' => 'Yes. Alongside Brough and Elloughton we clean homes in Welton, South Cave, North Ferriby, Melton and smaller villages such as Ellerker and Broomfleet. If you live further out towards the Wolds or Gilberdyke, send us your postcode and we will let you know whether we can offer a regular slot.' ],
				[ 'question' => 'Is regular cleaning worthwhile in a brand new home?', 'answer' => 'Many new-build owners like to start regular cleaning soon after moving in, while everything is still in good condition. Keeping on top of limescale, grout and kitchen grease from the start stops them becoming hard work later. If construction dust is still settling, we may suggest an after builders clean first.' ],
				[ 'question' => 'Can I have a cleaner while I work from home?', 'answer' => 'Of course. Plenty of people in Brough work from home for part of the week. Tell us which room you use as an office and when your calls usually happen, and your cleaner can work around you, leaving the study until last or skipping it on certain days.' ],
				[ 'question' => 'What if I want an extra visit before guests arrive?', 'answer' => 'Just ask. Regular customers can book an extra clean, a longer visit or a one-off oven clean when they need it, subject to availability. Give us as much notice as you can around busy times like Christmas and the school holidays, and we will try to send your usual cleaner.' ],
