				[ 'question' => 'Is it worth cleaning while the rest of the estate is still being built?', 'answer' => 'Yes. Where building work is still going on nearby, some dust and mud will keep coming in for a while. We can do a thorough clean when you move in and a lighter follow-up later, and we will give you tips for keeping dust down until the last homes on the street are finished.' ],
